msgid ""
"Due to using Solid and Phonon DragonPlayer is independent of any multimedia "
"framework or hardware abstraction layer"
msgstr ""
"Pola mor del usu de Solid y Phonon,  DragonPlayer ye independiente de "
"cualesquier framework multimedia o HAL"

